         libheif-dev
Description: Lingmo SDK - development files
 The SDK every Lingmo application is built with: a Wayland client for
 lingmo-compositor that draws with Skia on GLES, with retained views, text
 layout, controls and frame-paced animation.
 .
 This package contains the header files, CMake configuration, and static
 libraries needed to build applications against Lingmo SDK.
